  "story": {
    "title": "Sita and her pencil",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Sita is a girl. She likes writing. Whenever she writes, she feels so happy! She writes about the bees. She writes about the trees. She writes about the swing and about everything.",
      "One day Sita saw a bird on a tree. It had feathers and a beak. It was singing sweetly and Sita loved it. “I am going to write about this bird,” said Sita. She looked inside her bag to take out a book and her pencil. She looked and looked and looked, but the pencil wasn’t there.",
      "“Where did my pencil go?” thought Sita. She ran back to her house to look for it. She looked on the floor. She looked on the chair. She looked everywhere, but the pencil wasn’t there.",
      "“What happened, dear? Why are you sad?” asked her mother, looking at the girl. “I can’t find my pencil, Amma,” said Sita. “Oh, dear! I am so sorry. I took your pencil in the morning. I forgot to put it , but it is on the rack,” spoke Amma, sounding sorry. It must feel so bad to see your daughter .",
      "Amma came out with a pencil and Sita’s eyes shone with a twinkle. She took the pencil from her mother’s hand and started dancing all around. Now Sita can write about everything again. She can write stories. She can write poems. She can write a song and we can sing along."
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "Sita is a girl.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sita là một cô bé."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She likes writing.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé thích viết."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Whenever she writes, she feels so happy!",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mỗi khi viết, cô bé cảm thấy rất vui!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She writes about the bees.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé viết về những chú ong."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She writes about the trees.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé viết về những cái cây."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She writes about the swing and about everything.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé viết về cái xích đu và về mọi thứ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "One day Sita saw a bird on a tree.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một ngày nọ, Sita thấy một chú chim trên cây."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It had feathers and a beak.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó có lông và một cái mỏ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It was singing sweetly and Sita loved it.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó hót líu lo và Sita rất thích."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“I am going to write about this bird,” said Sita.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "“Mình sẽ viết về chú chim này,” Sita nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She looked inside her bag to take out a book and her pencil.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé nhìn vào trong túi để lấy sách và bút chì ra."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She looked and looked and looked, but the pencil wasn’t there.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé tìm mãi, tìm mãi, nhưng không thấy bút chì đâu."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“Where did my pencil go?” thought Sita.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "“Bút chì của mình đâu rồi?” Sita nghĩ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She ran back to her house to look for it.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé chạy về nhà để tìm nó."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She looked on the floor.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé nhìn trên sàn nhà."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She looked on the chair.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé nhìn trên ghế."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She looked everywhere, but the pencil wasn’t there.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé tìm khắp nơi, nhưng không thấy bút chì đâu."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“What happened, dear?",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "“Chuyện gì vậy con yêu?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Why are you sad?” asked her mother, looking at the girl.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sao con buồn vậy?” mẹ cô bé hỏi, nhìn cô bé."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“I can’t find my pencil, Amma,” said Sita.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "“Con không tìm thấy bút chì của con, mẹ ơi,” Sita nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“Oh, dear! I am so sorry.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "“Ôi con yêu! Mẹ xin lỗi nhiều."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I took your pencil in the morning.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_021.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ đã lấy bút chì của con vào buổi sáng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I forgot to put it , but it is on the rack,” spoke Amma, sounding sorry.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_022.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ quên không để lại, nhưng nó ở trên giá đó,” mẹ Sita nói, giọng hối lỗi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It must feel so bad to see your daughter .",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_023.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chắc hẳn mẹ cảm thấy rất tệ khi thấy con gái mình buồn."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Amma came out with a pencil and Sita’s eyes shone with a twinkle.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_024.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ Sita đi ra với cây bút chì và mắt Sita sáng lên lấp lánh."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She took the pencil from her mother’s hand and started dancing all around.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_025.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé cầm bút chì từ tay mẹ và bắt đầu nhảy múa khắp nơi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Now Sita can write about everything again.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_026.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bây giờ Sita lại có thể viết về mọi thứ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She can write stories.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_027.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé có thể viết truyện."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She can write poems.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_028.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé có thể viết thơ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She can write a song and we can sing along.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13729/s_029.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé có thể viết một bài hát và chúng ta có thể hát theo."
      }
    ]
  },
